*** Test Cases ***
Sensor Data Processing
    ${sensor_value}=    Set Variable    invalid_data
    TRY
        Log    Processing sensor data: ${sensor_value}
        ${result}=    Evaluate    int('${sensor_value}')
        Log    Converted to: ${result}
    EXCEPT    ValueError    AS    ${err}
        Log    ValueError caught: ${err}
        Log    Using default value instead
        ${result}=    Set Variable    0
    EXCEPT    AS    ${err}
        Log    Other error: ${err}
        Fail    Unexpected error type
    END
    Log    Processing result: ${result}
